      },
      "content": "🚀 We are officially hiring for Backend Engineers and Machine Learning Engineers at Nimbus Technologies! \n\nAt Nimbus, we don't do black-box filtering or 6-round marathon puzzles. Every candidate who applies gets an explainable evaluation with concrete skill-by-skill evidence. \n\nKey skills we love: TypeScript, PostgreSQL, Distributed Systems, and Python for ML.\n\nCheck out the open roles on our Jobs tab or send a direct connection request if you'd like to chat!",
