    {
      "id": "post-2",
      "author": {
        "id": "candidate-alex-morgan",
        "name": "Alex Morgan",
        "headline": "Full-Stack & Machine Learning Engineer | Ex-Stripe Intern",
        "role": "CANDIDATE"
      },
      "content": "🎉 Proud to share our new project: 'GenerateVerify — LLM Quiz Evaluation & Grounding Engine'!\n\nWe benchmarked three AI generation strategies across grounding, correctness, clarity, and cognitive-demand scores. GenerateVerify achieved 100% strongly grounded questions with high consistency.\n\nKey takeaway: Deterministic verification on top of generative models drastically reduces hallucinations compared to raw prompt chains.\n\nRepo is open source, feedback is warmly welcomed!",
      "category": "Project",
      "tags": [
        "MachineLearning",
        "OpenSource",
        "LLM",
        "Python",
        "Evaluation"
      ],
      "projectUrl": "https://github.com/adityam260206/Content-Generator-AI",
      "demoUrl": "http://localhost:3000",
      "likes": 47,
      "likedBy": [
        "dada95c8-3767-4578-83ef-99a8f12fa7f4",
        "interviewer-elena"
      ],
      "comments": [
        {
          "id": "comment-2-1",
          "postId": "post-2",
          "author": {
            "id": "interviewer-elena",
            "name": "Dr. Elena Rostova",
            "headline": "Principal Systems Architect",
            "role": "INTERVIEWER"
          },
          "content": "Impressive rigor on the cognitive-demand metrics, Alex. How did you handle confounding factors in question yield?",
